@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@vehicleId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Check vehicle availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/check?start=2026-11-20T09:00:00%2B07:00&end=2026-11-22T18:00:00%2B07:00
Accept: application/json

###

### Get vehicle calendar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/availability/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/calendar
Accept: application/json

###

### Create an owner schedule block
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/availability/vehicles/{{vehicleId}}/blocks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "startTime": "2026-12-01T08:00:00+07:00",
  "endTime": "2026-12-02T18:00:00+07:00",
  "reason": "Vehicle maintenance"
}
